# Who may read (subscribe) and write (publish) which topics. # = everything below.
# A publish to a topic the user may not write is silently dropped, so check this file first
# when a device "sends" but nothing arrives.

# You, for debugging with mosquitto_sub / mosquitto_pub
user admin
topic readwrite #

# Sensor nodes (ESP32 firmware) and the simulator: publish readings only
user sensor
topic write home/#

# ingestion/: stores every reading
user ingestion
topic read home/#

# Laravel (mqtt:listen, later commands to lights and cameras)
user laravel
topic read home/#
